// sprits_fast.rc -- what Windows shows for the program before it runs: the
// icon in Explorer, on a shortcut and pinned to the taskbar. The first icon
// in the executable is the one Windows takes. SDL registers the window with
// it too; app_window.cpp still sets the window's own from the PNGs, which is
// what every other platform uses.

1 ICON "../../assets/icon/sprits_fast.ico"
